<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 30.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 30.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- The minister responsible for ethnic relations, Andra Veidemann, said that Russia's attitude to Estonia is changing for the better.</p>
<p>- The central police investigation office charged suspended police officer Jaan Ruutman with negligence resulting in bodily injury over an accidential shooting of a bystander.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
